# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# (Git does not understand trailing comments: every pattern below sits alone on
#  its line. Explaining them inline silently disabled all of them.)
# Your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials:
config/api_keys.json
# The dashboard's TLS private key and certificate:
config/certs/
# Chave HMAC de recibos de tool calls (segredo critografico):
config/certs/tool_hmac.key
# A LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands somebody your account:
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins):
**/token*.json
# Google OAuth client secrets:
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*
.qoder-proxy.env

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/continuity.json
# The continuous conversation index and speaker voiceprints:
memory/chat/
memory/voices/
memory/*.db
# WhatsApp messages it kept (the session itself lives in config/whatsapp_web/):
memory/whatsapp_inbox.jsonl
memory/whatsapp_inbox_*.jsonl
memory/email_otp_seen.json
# E-mail: headers of what arrived, the parked send (recipient + body) and the
# per-account state dir — personal data, never in the repository:
memory/mail_inbox_*.jsonl
memory/mail_send_pending.json
config/mail/
# Personas criadas pelo dono, catálogo de modelos e vínculos projeto/persona:
memory/personas.json
memory/models.json
memory/projects.json
memory/tasks.json
.mypy_cache/
# Attachments received on WhatsApp (photos, voice notes, documents):
memory/whatsapp_media/
# Screenshots captured from the Mac and voice samples of the owner:
memory/mac/
amostra-voz.mp3
# Attachments received on WhatsApp, one media dir per account (the bare
# memory/whatsapp_media/ above misses the per-account variants):
memory/whatsapp_media*/
# Continuous classified microphone audio and its JSONL events (sensitive):
memory/audio_ledger/

# ── Backups locais que carregam segredos ou dados pessoais ────────────────────
# Cópias datadas feitas à mão antes de editar credenciais. As de api_keys.json
# contêm as chaves reais do Fish e do Groq: publicá-las entrega as contas.
config/api_keys.json.backup-*
config/api_keys.json.bak-*
# Cópia da fila de tarefas antes de reescrevê-la:
memory/tasks.json.bak-*
# Estado de retomada de um restart, recriado a cada boot:
memory/restart_last_pending.json
# Estado por conta de e-mail (config/mail/ acima já cobre o diretório inteiro;
# esta linha sobrevive a um eventual afrouxamento daquela regra):
config/mail/*/state.json

# ── Local tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Qoder CLI session data and per-machine permission settings:
.qoder/
# Node sidecar dependencies (the lockfile stays tracked):
qoder_live/node_modules/

# ── Binaries installed without root ──────────────────────────────────────────
# ffmpeg/ffprobe extraídos dos .deb do Ubuntu (tools/ffmpeg/bin + lib). Para
# recriar: apt-get download ffmpeg libavdevice62 libplacebo360 libopenal1
# libdc1394-25 && dpkg -x cada .deb e copiar usr/bin/* + usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/*
tools/ffmpeg/

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# ── Dados de uso criados em tempo de execução (fork João Gabriel) ─────────────
memory/organizer.json
memory/usage.json
memory/series_mode.json
memory/briefing_state.json
memory/comm_review_state.json
memory/restart_last.json
memory/music_cache/
*.lnk
models/
